<title>GERMANY: Kohl to visit Ireland before EU special summit.</title>
<headline>Kohl to visit Ireland before EU special summit.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl will visit Ireland on October 2 and 3, two days before a special European Union summit, a German government spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Ireland holds the six-month rotating presidency of the EU and has called the October 5 summit in Dublin to give new impetus to the inter-governmental conference working on a reform of EU structures.</p>
</text>
